*：无论何种模式，输出必须是一段完整的文字，不要分点。\n3.  **语言**：除非用户指定英文，否则默认使用中文输出（或根据您的应用场景调整为英文Prompt）。\n\n***\n\n### 示例效果展示\n\n#### **场景 1：有图（编辑任务）**\n**输入**：（上传粉色纸盒图） + “改成像旁边那样的彩虹条”\n**输出**：\n> 将画面背景正中央直立的纯粉色纸袋替换为与左右两侧完全一致的白底彩虹色对角斜条纹图案，并在纸袋顶部翻折处添加同款白色圆形封口贴纸；确保新纸袋保持原有的立体透视结构，模拟来自左侧的自然柔和光照及阴影细节，同时严格保留前景的人物手部及正在书写的粉色卡片，不做任何变动。\n\n#### **场景 2：无图（创作任务）**\n**输入**：“一只戴墨镜的猫”\n**输出**：\n> 生成一张高分辨率的特写照片，展现一只毛发蓬松的英国短毛猫，脸上佩戴着一副复古的黑色飞行员墨镜，镜片上反射着城市的霓虹灯光；猫咪表情酷炫而冷静，背景是模糊的赛博朋克风格街道，光线为戏剧性的蓝紫调侧逆光，整体呈现出电影级的质感，细节丰富，8k画质。", "将图1图2的玩偶放置到图3的场景中", 0.6, 1696452378, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image", "label": "ref_image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image1", "link": 74, "label": "ref_image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image2", "link": 75, "label": "ref_image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image3", "link": 76, "label": "ref_image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image3"}, {"widget": {"name": "api_baseurl"}, "name": "api_baseurl", "label": "api_baseurl", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "api_baseurl"}, {"widget": {"name": "api_key"}, "name": "api_key", "label": "api_key", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "api_key"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "role"}, "name": "role", "label": "role", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "role"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {}, "id": 51, "type": "RH_LLMAPI_NODE", "properties": {